    "REPULSOR BLAST": "斥力爆破",
    "FIRE NANO PULSE CANNONS THAT <style=cIsHealth>HARM HOSTILE COMBATANTS</style> AND <style=cIsHealing>HEAL FRIENDLY COMBATANTS</style> FOR <style=cIsDamage>220%</style>.": "发射纳米脉冲炮，<style=cIsHealth>伤害敌人</style>并<style=cIsHealing>治疗盟友</style>，两者均为基础伤害的<style=cIsDamage>220%</style>。",
    "IMPERATIVE: PATCH": "命令:补丁",
